WEBVTT

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:53.030
Once you finish cleaning up the dung, start laying the straw bedding.

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:56.730
Make sure it's as clean as you like your own bedrooms.

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:58.120
Okay!

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:28.000
What are you looking at?

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.240
Erin-sensei.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:35.470
Nothing in particular.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:42.120
I was only relieved that the Queen's visit went well, and without any trouble.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:51.860
But if the Queen finds out that you can fly in the sky on a beast-lord's back...

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:53.550
I wonder how she would take that.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.400
Kiriku-sensei!

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:14.590
I have tight lips, so you don't have to worry.

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:25.890
Attack of the Touda

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:30.880
The Queen's returning on a boat?

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:37.330
Yes.  She'll be going down the Kazalm River that runs nearby.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:42.140
Then we'd probably get a great view from the hill overlooking it!

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:47.410
Karisa, it's very rude to look down on the Queen from the top of a hill.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:49.900
Oh, you're so right.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:51.780
Excuse us.

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:52.760
Come in.

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:58.340
Esal-sensei.  We'd like to take the students out for a field study.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.330
"Field study?"

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:02.700
Like Erin-sensei often does,

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:07.550
we'd like to let them see the plants from their textbooks in reality, with their own eyes.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:12.080
The students need to learn about more than just beast-lords.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.690
Shouldn't we?

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.740
It's a good idea.

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:21.450
Don't you think?!

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:25.600
But don't go too far out and slip down the hill.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:29.720
And you're going out there for a field study.

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:32.250
Make sure you have them be studious.

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:33.550
Understood?

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:37.040
Thank you very much.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:43.330
We have her permission!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:46.880
We'll get to see the boat!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.420
I can't wait!

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.120
Let's get ready for it!

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.820
It's a field trip!

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:13.500
Shunan-sama, here are the reports from the current Touda cavalry.

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:16.460
Good work.  I'll look through them.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.950
Ngan-sama has returned.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:23.120
Ngan has?

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:44.180
Shunan...  Shunan...

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:55.800
<i>Those guys from the Queen's quarter... no, those </i>Holons<i> just don't understand!</i>

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:01.260
<i>We protect a pure Queen</i>

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:03.370
<i>who is the descendant of the gods and enriches the country.</i>

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:06.830
<i>Father!  I cannot permit those words to pass my ears!</i>

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:09.640
<i>Have you forgotten to have a heart of loyalty toward the Queen?</i>

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:17.020
Ngan.

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:22.950
I'm glad that you're back.

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:24.880
It's a critical time for our father, after all.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:28.620
But I intend to leave as soon as possible.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.730
There are soldiers on the front lines waiting for me.

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:36.120
Regarding that, I want you to ease off your activity in the war.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:40.210
Have you heard that the Queen is out of the capital?

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.670
Yes.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:46.200
Having the Touda cavalry move actively at such at time

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:49.870
could cause unnecessary misunderstanding by the citizens of the Queen's quarter.

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:55.140
Then I shall eradicate Larza to eliminate all misunderstanding.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:07:00.060
You know the Saigamul has also become more active, don't you?

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:05.570
This country's distortion is already at the point of no return.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:12.150
We have accepted taint to protect the Queen and this country for several generations.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:14.620
It will not change even in our age.

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:20.370
We will show our loyalty by performing our duty.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.250
<i>Why, Ani-ue?</i>

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:35.000
<i>You were always correct!</i>

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:40.630
<i>You always showed me the path, strongly and clearly!</i>

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.090
<i>Yet, why?!</i>

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:47.240
<i>I always knew what your ideal is.</i>

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:50.070
<i>But I must go!</i>

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:59.310
<i>I can't allow myself to be stopped!</i>

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:35.930
Damiya, I've never before felt myself be closer to this country.

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:38.370
That is great news, Your Majesty.

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:42.270
If it wasn't for the beast-lord's baby,

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:46.860
I never would have thought about going out of the palace.

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:54.770
I was able to see how the people in this country really live.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:59.080
You are the light which illuminates the path those people walk on.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:00.800
You're right.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:09.480
If my existence as the Queen helps the citizens, then I shall live accordingly.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.680
<i>On the way there it's uphill, so we can't do much about that, </i>

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:18.620
<i>but on the way back, shouldn't we stay at Sir Kazalm's place,</i>

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.080
<i>then go down the river?</i>

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:29.990
<i>Considering the Queen's physical condition, a ship would be much easier for her.</i>

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:43.560
I wonder if my grandmother's about to get on the homeward-bound ship.

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:49.480
I'm sure.  It's this type of weather, too, so I'm sure the view from Kazalm River will be beautiful.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:54.470
I see.  I look forward to hearing her stories.

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:13.870
Welcome.  Welcome to Kazalm.

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:21.920
Our great, holy Queen.

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:37.930
The beast-lords will spread their wings and welcome you, too.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:45.910
We will hold hands, form a circle, and welcome the Queen,
who is our light.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:00.910
One per person, everyone.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:02.520
Everyone's being such a kid.

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:04.010
What did you bring?

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:06.850
Wow, how nice!

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:12.280
Is her boat not here yet?

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:15.380
It's here!

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:16.360
Really?

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.060
That's her boat?

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:26.370
No, not that one.  Look.

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:39.870
Wow!  An entire castle is on that boat.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.940
I've never seen anything like that.

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:02.950
It's beautiful.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:07.090
This was worth the trip we made.

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:07.900
You're right.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.090
Huh?  What's that?

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:22.090
What's wrong, Shiron?

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:25.260
Something's coming from the arm of the river.

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:47.880
Touda!

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:55.370
Touda!

00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:58.450
There's Touda here!

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:03.730
They're approaching her ship.

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:05.090
Are they going to...?

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:20.990
Touda incoming!

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:22.550
We have a raid here!  Get your bows and arrows!

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:30.350
Touda?!  Are you saying the Grand Duke's cavalry is attacking us?!

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:34.770
I don't know.  But I won't let them near here.

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:37.740
Damiya-sama, please protect Her Majesty for a brief moment.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:39.960
I understand.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:40.960
Ial.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:42.950
Be careful.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:44.200
Of course.

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:06.860
The Touda are going to get the Queen...

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:38.420
The lead ships were sunk.

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.300
This is terrible!

00:14:58.510 --> 00:15:00.470
Erin!  What are you planning on doing?!

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:01.640
I'll go after her!

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:07.340
Kyle!  More are coming from behind!

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:21.880
Be careful about the rear guard, too!

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:25.560
Lilan!

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:29.610
Lilan, let me on your back.

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:32.330
The Queen's being attacked by Touda.

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:33.890
Stop it!

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:37.400
Why?!  We have to hurry and save her!

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:39.830
You can't!  I can't let you fly off.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:46.070
If you fly, people who will try to take advantage of you will show up!

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:23.790
I wish for you to carry on Soyon's intentions, she who died over the crime she committed.

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:37.370
I don't want to tie beast-lords down with codes made by humans,

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:43.010
and I cannot allow people to die in front of me.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:18.950
That damn Grand Duke!

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:22.080
Is he planning on assassinating the Queen using Touda?!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.580
A beast-lord?

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:05.840
It's flying with a person on its back!

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:16.160
Erin.

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:25.900
We can't let her interfere with our plan.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:32.800
Lilan!  Go over there one more time!

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:36.740
Lilan?

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:42.160
Lilan?

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.190
Lilan!

00:19:39.270 --> 00:19:45.330
Lilan ripped through the Touda with her sharp claws and fangs.

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:53.650
As the sweet scent of Touda mucus and blood filled the air,

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:56.890
all the humans could do

00:19:56.890 --> 00:20:04.350
was look on at the beast-lord's wild instinct to molest Touda with abandon.

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:17.750
Lilan!  You can stop now!

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:20.320
Stop!  Please Lilan!

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:26.770
Your Majesty!  Your Majesty!

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:33.930
Damiya-sama!  The Queen isn't waking up!

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:39.670
What is that noise?

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:15.270
This is the sacred beast that descended to Tahai Aze from atop Ephon Noha.

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:25.490
The power of the King that destroys even a thousand Touda.

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:40.070
And...

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:44.930
The pure girl who manipulates it...

00:21:54.050 --> 00:21:56.500
How wonderful!

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:16.160
"This is something I created."

00:22:17.870 --> 00:22:21.860
As she felt crushed by the reality before her,

00:22:21.860 --> 00:22:28.520
Erin continued staring at the scene, without averting her eyes.

00:24:02.190 --> 00:24:06.440
The ship was attacked by Touda
on its way back to the palace.

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:11.710
The Queen, who is unconscious, has been
taken to Sir Kazalm's estate.

00:24:11.710 --> 00:24:16.760
Before such great power, the Sezans were nothing but a defenseless shield.

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:21.970
Unable to protect what I should have,
how am I supposed to live on?

00:24:21.970 --> 00:24:25.050
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Falling into Shadow.

00:24:25.050 --> 00:26:00.030
Falling into Shadow
